    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/packers-movers-company/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Packers Movers Company is a specialized relocation and logistics theme designed for packers and movers services, moving companies, transportation businesses, logistics providers, freight services, home shifting companies, office relocation experts, warehouse movers, and vehicle transport services. It is ideal for showcasing house shifting, office relocation, furniture moving, packing and unpacking services, loading and unloading, long-distance moving, local shifting, international relocation, truck rental services, and moving insurance solutions in a structured and professional way. With a clean, modern, and fully responsive layout, it ensures seamless browsing across desktops, tablets, and smartphones while maintaining fast performance and SEO-friendly structure for better search visibility. The theme includes service listings, quote request forms, booking sections, pricing tables, customer testimonials, and contact forms to help convert visitors into clients efficiently. Built with optimized and secure code, it integrates smoothly with WooCommerce for online service bookings and payments, Contact Form 7 for inquiry and quotation management, and WPForms for lead generation and customer communication. Customization options for layouts, colors, and typography allow full branding flexibility, making it suitable for local movers, national logistics companies, and global relocation services. Packers Movers Company provides a complete digital platform to manage moving services, generate leads, and build a strong professional presence in the competitive relocation and transport industry."
    },
